[Changelogs]
   - Added:

	- UI overhaul with Theme Switcher.
	- Added Market tab in Extras.
	- Added Map for Entropia.
	- Logged in clients in profiles are remembered for individual settings.
	- Added auto start to load saved ftool/macro/quickcommands for profiles on login.
	- QuickCommand window has a 'Run commands on open' checkbox
	- QuickCommand window has a 'Close after run' checkbox (closes the window once the run on open sequence finished).
	- Login coordinates now have the correct value set for all resolutions by default.



   - Fixed:

	- Fixed unresponsive buttons, if a macro was looping at low ms.
	- Clients without a profile can now login/reconnect through the Default profile.
	- Profile repair through copying the neuz doesnt break anymore.
	- Omtimized code of saving and fonts for better performance.
	- Hotkeys are editable in the settings again.
	- Past notifications can be reopened again.
	- Canceled reconnects/logins/launchs do not break the notifications anymore.
	- Some notifications not pausing on mouse hover.
	- Removed some duplicated functions.


